---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Blogs
description: Discover the stories on glass innovations. Explore industry insights, glass types, real-world applications, and practical tips to help you make informed decisions about glass solutions.
pageTitle: Blogs
pageSubtitle: Discover the Stories on Glass Innovations
heroImage: /assets/img/about/factory-banner.jpg
breadcrumbTrail:
  - label: Resources
  - label: Blogs
extraCss:
  - /assets/css/pages/inner-page.css
  - /assets/css/pages/blog.css
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="prose reveal" data-reveal>
      <p>Explore industry insights, glass types, real-world applications, and practical tips to help you make informed decisions about glass solutions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="blog-grid">
      {% for post in posts %}
      <article class="blog-card reveal" data-reveal>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="blog-card__link">
          <div class="blog-card__image-wrap">
            <img src="{{ post.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="420" height="280" class="blog-card__image" />
          </div>
          <p class="blog-card__date">{{ post.date }}</p>
          <h3 class="blog-card__title">{{ post.title }}</h3>
          <span class="blog-card__readmore">Read more</span>
        </a>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
